    "created_at": "2024-07-02T19:17:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-07-02T19:17:52Z",
    "body": "the dialog is not supposed to be included in the tab order of a web page.  \r\n\r\nit is meant to be focusable in the instance that there is no better place to place initial focus within a dialog, or in the rare instance that the dialog container was deemed to be the best initial focus placement by the author.  \r\n\r\nof the two, chrome is behaving more as i would have expected ",
