    "created_at": "2024-07-03T00:58:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-07-03T00:58:39Z",
    "body": "Individual user agents make various different decisions about what is focusable, and what is not. That is not something prescribed by the standard. For example, buttons are not tab-focusable in Safari (without toggling an OS setting), but are in Chrome/Firefox.\r\n\r\nSo there's not much the standard can do here.",
